*> ============================================================
*> GPTNEXUS NOBLE — DEMO DU LANGUAGE SYSTEMIQUE (DGK x GLM)
*> Le COBOL de DGK invoque les pouvoirs de GPTNexus directement :
*> scan, sonde d'exploit, memoire persistante, metriques.
*> ============================================================
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DEMO-MONSTRE.
AUTHOR. DGK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ETAPE PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    DISPLAY "=== GPTNEXUS NOBLE — LANGUAGE SYSTEMIQUE ==="
    PERFORM ETAPES 3 TIMES
    IF ETAPE = 3 THEN DISPLAY "MONSTRE NOBLE OPERATIONNEL" END-IF
    SCAN-FILE "fixtures/vuln_eval.py"
    PROBE-FILE "fixtures/vuln_eval.py" RULE "eval"
    REMEMBER "demo-noble" VALUE "v1.1"
    RECALL "demo-noble" DISPLAY
    NOTE-METRIC "demo-noble" VALUE 1
    STOP RUN.
ETAPES.
    ADD 1 TO ETAPE
    DISPLAY "ETAPE " ETAPE.
